  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "d95a553f-e43a-1244-a9ac-d7708e999712"],
 " and expands through geometric nearest-neighbor connections."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->161975985,ExpressionUUID->"3af040d0-3c6e-7b46-b126-5122f167cef4"],

Cell["\<\
Returns an association of point lists ordered from the deepest reachable \
layer to the lead-contact layer. Preserve this order when constructing \
scattering-region blocks.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1755072335,ExpressionUUID->"04f615d7-06dd-f94e-a1dd-75b3d1c26dee"],

Cell["\<\
Only the component reachable from the lead contacts is included. Verify that \
the total returned site count equals the intended scattering-region site \
count.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->753707919,ExpressionUUID->"f03ae6f1-df06-d345-a72c-7cfc16daffe7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Coordinates may be labeled with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Rule"]], "paclet:ref/Rule"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "30c4f5e1-2cf0-0e46-8f89-87b5a38d0db7"],
 " expressions; the geometric search uses their coordinate values."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->611523879,ExpressionUUID->"7fe4f21e-2c3f-894d-887f-8f2ed9bb6c9f"]
}, Closed]],

